  ObjectSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 541ba42f5fc21cd4a848b56fe19c642f, type: 3}
  Facts:
  - text: "The Gliding Shadow!\nStingrays flap their wide fins like wings, letting
      them glide smoothly across the ocean floor.\nThey often hide under sand, using
      their flat bodies for camouflage.\nTheir tail has a sharp, venomous barb\u2014used
      only for defense!\nWith eyes on top and a mouth underneath, they\u2019re built
      for sneaky snacking on clams and crustaceans."
